title: D1_00_Start
---
// Set cam
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>

<<enum TypeOfCocktail>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case HighAlcohol>>
    <<case LowAlcohol>>
    <<case NoneAlcohol>>
    <<case NotMatch>>
<<endenum>>
<<enum Satisfaction>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case Fail>>
    <<case Acceptable>>
    <<case Perfect>>
<<endenum>>
<<enum NPC_Name>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case Cole>>
    <<case Owen>>
    <<case Walter>>
    <<case Freya>>
    <<case Isla>>
<<endenum>>
<<enum LookDirection>>
    <<case None>>
    <<case Right>>
    <<case Left>>
    <<case Forward>>
<<endenum>>
// Declare the variable (set false by default)
<<declare $type_of_cocktail = TypeOfCocktail.None>>
<<declare $satisfaction = Satisfaction.None>>


<<jump D1_01_Walter_Arrive>>
===

title: D1_01_Walter_Arrive
---
<<MoveIn NPC_Name.Walter 1>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController NearLeftCam>>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "happy">>


//Walter greeting
Walter: Good evening.[waitfor=0.2/] It's been a long time since I last saw someone open something new in this town. #line:0
Walter: You must be the new face in town. #line:1
-> Welcome #line:2
    Player: Good evening, welcome to the bar. #line:3
    Player: Please, take your time and make yourself comfortable. #line:4
-> Honest #line:5
    Player: Yes, I just opened tonight. #line:6
    Player: Still trying to get used to how quiet this town is. #line:7
-> Friendly #line:8
    Player: Really? I thought I've been running this place since the 20th century. #line:9
    Walter: [wiggle]Haha... quite a talker.[/wiggle] #line:A
-> Formal #line:B
    Player: Welcome. It's a pleasure to have you as my first guest. #line:C

Walter: I'm Walter, by the way. #line:D
Player: Nice to meet you Mr. Walter. #line:E
Player: You can call me bartender. #line:F
Walter: Normally at this hour, I'd just be sitting in front of the TV. #line:10
Walter: [dangle]Old habits, I suppose.[/dangle] #line:11
Walter: But I saw a new place opening up, so I thought I'd drop by. #line:12
Walter: Wanted to see the new face in town for myself. #line:13
Player: Well, glad I opened the doors tonight. #line:14
Player: I'm sure this place will be better than TV. #line:15
Player: So, what will it be tonight? #line:16
<<jump D1_02_Walter_Order>>

===

title: D1_02_Walter_Order
---
//Walter's Order
Walter: Just keep it simple, son. #line:17
Walter: [order] "{Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Sea Breeze")}" [/order] should be enough for tonight. #line:18
Player: Coming right up. #line:19
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>


<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Fix_Camera CamController false>>
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>

//After Walter's order
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController NearLeftCam>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "happy">>
    Walter: [bounce]Spot on, son.[/bounce] #line:1A
    Walter: [wave]Balanced and clean.[/wave] You've got a steady hand for a new face. #line:1B
    Player: Thank you. #line:1C
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Walter: A bit off, but it's alright. #line:1D
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "upset">>
    Walter: [shake]I don't think this is what I asked for.[/shake] #line:1E
    Walter: [wiggle]My memory might be fading, but my tongue still works.[/wiggle] #line:1F
<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "neutral">>
<<jump D1_03_Walter_Talk>>
===

title: D1_03_Walter_Talk
---
//Town topic
Walter: Anyway, officially... welcome to our little valley, Bartender. #line:20
Walter: We don't get many newcomers around here. #line:21
Walter: So, tell me. What's your first impression? #line:22
Walter: How do you like our quiet town so far? #line:23

-> It feels cozy. #line:24
-> A bit too quiet. #line:25
-> Good for sleeping. #line:26
-> Peaceful. #line:27

Walter: Fair enough. #line:28
Walter: But don't worry, people will start trickling in once word gets out. #line:29

<<jump D1_04_Isla_Arrive>>
===

title: D1_04_Isla_Arrive
---
//Isla come in 
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>


<<Panel_FadeOut Panel_Transition>>
<<Panel_FadeIn Panel_Transition>>
<<wait 2>>


<<MoveIn NPC_Name.Isla 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController NearLeftCam>>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "happy">>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>

Isla: [fade]Good evening.[/fade] #line:2A
Player: Good evening. #line:2B
Isla: [wave]Wow, you've really done a wonderful job with this place.[/wave] #line:2C
Walter: Good evening Isla. How's work treating you? #line:2D
Isla: Same as always. Busy enough to forget what day it is. #line:2E
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
Isla: More importantly, how is that back pain of yours doing, Mr. Walter? #line:2F
Walter: Ah, don't worry about it, dear. #line:30
Walter: I'll just take a pill or two, and it'll clear right up. #line:31
Isla: [shake]Take care of yourself.[/shake] Taking medicine alone won't help. #line:32
-> Get well soon. #line:33
    Player: Take it easy, Walter. I need my favorite regular staying healthy. #line:34
    Walter: Thank you, Mr. Bartender. #line:35
-> She's right. #line:36
    Player: She's right, Walter. #line:37
    Player: Medicine only masks the pain, it doesn't fix it. #line:38
    Walter: [wiggle]Alright, alright, I'm surrounded by caretakers tonight, I see.[/wiggle] #line:39
-> I feel your pain. #line:3A
    Player: Just standing behind this counter all night is already killing my back. #line:3B
    Isla: [wave]Are you Ok?[/wave]  #line:3C
    Isla: You can let me check for you. #line:3D
    Player: Nah, it's ok. #line:3E
-> A toast to health. #line:3F
    Player: Well, they say the right drink can comfort any ache. #line:40
    Isla: [wiggle]Hey, but don't drink too much either.[/wiggle] #line:41

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
Isla: Oh by the way. my name is Isla. #line:42
Isla: I'm a nurse at the local clinic. #line:43
Player: I'm Bartender. Nice to meet you. #line:44
Isla: Yeah nice to meet you too. #line:45
Player: Would you like anything to drink? #line:46
Isla: Um... Let me see. #line:47
Isla: I have a morning shift tomorrow... #line:48
Isla: Do you have anything to recommend? #line:49
<<jump D1_05_Isla_Order>>
===

title: D1_05_Isla_Order
---
//-> Gin Fizz.
//-> Sea Breeze.
//-> Cranberry Fizz.
//-> Everything is recommended here.
Player: [swing]Everything is recommended here.[/swing] #line:4A
Isla: Umm... #line:4B
Isla: Okay, I'll have {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Cranberry fizz")}. #line:4C
Player: Got it. #line:4D

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>

<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Fix_Camera CamController false>>
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>

//After Isla's order
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController NearLeftCam>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
    Isla: [bounce]Oh, wow... this is incredible.[/bounce] #line:4E
    Isla: [rainb]Seriously, you have magic hands.[/rainb] #line:4F

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Isla: Oh, it tastes... a bit different from what I expected. #line:50
    Isla: But it's fine. #line:51

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "upset">>
    Isla: [shake]Uh... Bartender?[/shake] #line:52
    Isla: I think you might have grabbed the wrong bottle. #line:53
    Isla: It's definitely not what I asked for. #line:54

<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
<<jump D1_06_Isla_Talk>>
===

title: D1_06_Isla_Talk
---
Isla: Did you just move here? #line:55
Player: Yes, just a few days ago. #line:56
Isla: It's a nice little town, once you get used to the quiet. #line:57
Isla: Actually, I'm not from around here. #line:58
Isla: I was transferred here for work. #line:59
Walter: [wave]But she's become a part of the town now.[/wave] #line:5A
Isla: [wiggle]You're exaggerating, Mr. Walter.[/wiggle] #line:5B
Isla: I just... ended up staying longer than I planned. #line:5C
<<jump D1_07_Owen_Arrive>>
===


title: D1_07_Owen_Arrive
---
//Owen come in 
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Panel_FadeOut Panel_Transition>>
<<Panel_FadeIn Panel_Transition>>


<<MoveIn NPC_Name.Owen 3>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController CenterCam>>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "happy">>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>

Owen: [bounce a=3]Hey! hey!! Owen here![/bounce] #line:5D
Isla: [wiggle]Ugh keep your voice down Owen.[/wiggle] #line:5E
Owen: My bad, Isla. Nice to see you. #line:5F
Owen: Oh and good evening Mr. Walter. How's your back? #line:60
Walter: Isla already asked. I'm fine, Owen. #line:61
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Walter "neutral">>
Owen: [shake]Wait, wait, wait[/shake] — new face behind the bar? #line:62
Owen: I thought I knew everyone in town. #line:63
Owen: Since when did this place have a bartender? #line:64
-> Hello! #line:65
    Player: Hello. I'm a Bartender. #line:66
    Player: I just opened a few days ago. #line:67
    Owen: Newcomer? Glad to see you. #line:68
-> Just the bartender. #line:69
    Player: Just the bartender. #line:6A
    Owen: [swing]Just the bartender? No name, no story?[/swing] #line:6B
    Owen: Mysterious. I like it. #line:6C
-> Hey! Hey!! #line:6D
    Player: hey! Hey!! Bartender here! #line:6E
    Owen: [bounce]Now that's the spirit![/bounce] #line:6F
-> Good evening. #line:70
    Player: Good evening. I'm Bartender, nice to meet you. #line:71
    Owen: [wiggle]Whoa, so formal. I'm speechless.[/wiggle] #line:72
    Owen: Nice to meet you. #line:73

Owen: Well, you picked the right town to open a bar. #line:74
Owen: Looks like I've finally got a regular spot. #line:75
Isla: [wiggle]You show up everywhere, Owen.[/wiggle] #line:76
Owen: I'm easy-going. I'm fine with anywhere. #line:77
<<jump D1_08_Owen_Order>>
===

title: D1_08_Owen_Order
---
Owen: Oh right, I should probably order before the bartender kicks me out. #line:78
Owen: I'll have {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}. #line:79
Player: One moment. #line:7A
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>

<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
