    Owen: [bounce]I should have gone to bartender school instead.[/bounce] #line:7C

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Owen: I'm not sure, but it feels like something's missing. #line:7D
    Owen: [wiggle]But it's better than not being able to drink.[/wiggle] #line:7E

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "upset">>
    Owen: Hmm...[waitfor=0.2/] I hate to say it, but I think something went sideways here. #line:7F
<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
