title: D1_09_Owen_Talk
---
Owen: Anyway. #line:80
Owen: I didn't tell you what I do for a living, did I? #line:81
Owen: Guess what I do for a living. #line:82
Owen: The hint is nature. #line:83
-> Gardener #line:84
    Owen: [wiggle]Nope. Do I look like that?[/wiggle] #line:85
-> Lumberjack #line:86
    Owen: [shake]The opposite![/shake] #line:87
-> Wildlife conservationist #line:88
    Owen: [bounce]Close! You're actually the first person to get that close.[/bounce] #line:89
-> You have a job? #line:8A
    Owen: [shake]Hey! What's that supposed to mean?[/shake] #line:8B

Owen: I'm a forest ranger. #line:8C
Owen: I take care of the forests and the wildlife. #line:8D
Owen: You got closer than Isla ever did. #line:8E
Owen: First time we met, she thought I was homeless. #line:8F
Isla: [shake a=2]It's because you were climbing a tree behind my dorm![/shake] #line:90
Isla: And you looked all scruffy. #line:91
Owen: Because I climbed up to catch the raccoon. #line:92
Isla: [shake]Then you fell off the tree. I was shocked.[/shake] #line:93
Owen: Luckily, it wasn't anything serious. #line:94
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>
Isla: Your ankle sprained. #line:95
Owen: At least it's not broken. #line:96
Player: And what about the raccoon? #line:97
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
Owen: It ran away before we could catch it. #line:98
Owen: It was rummaging through the trash at Cole's house. #line:99
Isla: [wiggle]That poor raccoon probably didn't know what hit him.[/wiggle] #line:9A
Owen: [wiggle]Hey, I was very gentle.[/wiggle] #line:9B
<<jump D1_10_Walter_Leave>>
===

title: D1_10_Walter_Leave
---
<<Panel_FadeOut Panel_Transition>>
<<wait 1.6>>
<<Panel_FadeIn Panel_Transition>>

Walter: I think I should go now. #line:9C
Owen: [wiggle]Already? But I just got here.[/wiggle] #line:9D
Walter: It's late now, Owen. #line:9E
Walter: [dangle]I'm not as young as I used to be.[/dangle] #line:9F
Walter: I guess I'll have to let the young people continue the conversation. #line:A0
Owen: [bounce]You're still a youth.[/bounce] #line:A1
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
Walter: [wiggle]Ha. Nice try, Owen.[/wiggle] But flattery won't keep me up past my bedtime. #line:A2
Isla: Take care of yourself, Mr. Walter. #line:A3
Player: Get home safely, Mr. Walter. #line:A4
Walter: Thank you. You guys take care too. #line:A5
Owen: [wiggle]Take care, old man.[/wiggle] #line:A6
<<MoveOut NPC_Name.Walter>>
<<jump D1_11_Bar_Talk>>
===

title: D1_11_Bar_Talk
---
//After Walter leave
Isla: Hey, Mr. Bartender. #line:A7
Player: Yes. #line:A8
Isla: Do you mind if I ask why you moved here? #line:A9
Player: Of course not. #line:AA

-> I needed a change of pace. #line:AB
    Player: You know, I just want to find something new in my life. #line:AC
    Isla: Did you find it? #line:AD
    Player: Nope, still looking. #line:AE
-> I'm bored with the city. #line:AF
    Player: The bright lights of the city aren't really my thing. #line:B0
    Isla: I get that. #line:B1
    Owen: Don't worry, it's so quiet here you can hear the leaves falling. #line:B2
    Owen: [wiggle]Some people find it peaceful. Others last two weeks.[/wiggle] #line:B3
-> Someone recommended this place. #line:B4
    Player: They said this is the perfect place to unwind. #line:B5
    Isla: May I ask who? #line:B6
    Player: It doesn't matter. I'm here now. #line:B7
-> I Don't know. #line:B8
    Player: I just want to come here. #line:B9
    Isla: [wave]That's... actually kind of freeing to hear.[/wave] #line:BA
    Owen: [bounce]Honestly? Respect. That takes guts.[/bounce] #line:BB

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
Isla: [wave]Anyway, welcome to town.[/wave] #line:BC
Isla: You'll get used to it soon. #line:BD
Player: Thank you. #line:BE
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
Owen: Just don't provoke Cole, okay? #line:BF
Player: Who's Cole? #line:C0
Owen: He's our local officer. #line:C1
Owen: I don't talk to him much, but he's [shake]incredibly scary[/shake]. #line:C2
Isla: Not quite that bad. He's a good person. #line:C3
Owen: [wiggle]Maybe, but it's still scary.[/wiggle] #line:C4
Isla: [wiggle]You talk as if you're not terrifying yourself, climbing trees in people's yards.[/wiggle] #line:C5
Owen: [shake]It's a job![/shake] #line:C6
Player: If I find a raccoon, I'll call. #line:C7
Owen: Anytime, except when sleeping. #line:C8
<<jump D1_12_Isla_Leave>>
===

title: D1_12_Isla_Leave
---
