Isla: I should probably go. #line:CA
Owen: [wiggle]Come on, I was enjoying the conversation.[/wiggle] #line:CB
Isla: I have an early shift tomorrow. #line:CC
Owen: [dangle]Fine...[/dangle] #line:CD
